  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Joint Response 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forty years of war, recurrent natural disasters, chronic poverty and drought have devastated the people of Afghanistan. The recent upheaval has only exacerbated needs and further complicated an extremely challenging operational context. TdH-NL, through its sister organisation Tdh Lausanne, will implement a project in&amp;nbsp;Nangarhar, in health (maternal health, MHPSS and SRHR awareness), FSL (life skills and subgrants) and MPC.</narrative>
  </description>
